# Workflows

Dev install: `pip install -e .[dev]` (Python 3.10).

Validate a task config:

```bash
python -c "from cornet.config.loader import load_unified; load_unified('tasks/<name>/config.yaml')"
```

Run and inspect:

```bash
python -m cornet tasks/<name>
python -m cornet view tasks/<name>
python -m cornet ui tasks/<name>
```

Unit tests match CI. Integration tests stay deselected:

```bash
make test
```

Run `-m integration` only when asked, and only if NS-3 or Mininet is installed.

After editing `cornet/config/schema.py`, regenerate the schema page with `make docs`. That file is generated by `scripts/gen_schema_docs.py`.

NS-3 is at `$NS3_DIR` or `~/ns-3-dev`. The validated patch lane is `scripts/patches/ns3/v2.4-ns3.38`. Check `scripts/patches/ns3/CAPABILITY_MATRIX.yaml` and `make compat-check` before depending on a scheduler or PDCP feature. `v4.2-ns3.47` is rebased and still waiting on runtime validation.

Framework changes go through OpenSpec: `/opsx-propose`, optional `/opsx-discuss`, `/opsx-apply`, `/opsx-archive`.
